# GitHub language statistics
#
# Without these, the repository reports as ~40% HTML and ~33% CSS, because the
# documentation site dominates by bytes: the rendered demo dashboards under
# docs-site/static/dashboards are glyf's own `glyf build` output, and
# docs-site/src/css/custom.css is the Docusaurus theme. Neither describes what
# this project is. Marked up, the report reads Python ~66% / Rust ~15%.
#
# These attributes only affect Linguist's accounting (and diff collapsing for
# generated files). Nothing is excluded from the build or the package.

# Rendered dashboards committed so the docs gallery can link to them. These are
# build artifacts, not source.
docs-site/static/dashboards/** linguist-generated=true

# The documentation site is documentation.
docs-site/** linguist-documentation=true
